// WAD04_6 -- the tail of zViewport.cpp and all of zScaleform.cpp, in the
// order retail's unity build laid them out.
//
// This file was generated by tools/gen_accessors.py with four accessors
// (zViewportGetActiveCount, TRC::SaveLoadBase::SetSaveEnabled,
// zScaleform::stopMovie and zScaleform::movieStopped); it has been taken
// over by hand and the banner removed. The four are kept, byte-identical.
//
// Layouts are the DWARF's (alltypes.h): zViewport 0x810 with the 3D
// viewport at +0, the UI viewport at +0x2DC, the camera at +0x5B8 and
// three bools at +0x80C; Graphics::Viewport 0x2DC with its Rect2D at
// +0x4C; zCam 0x254 starting with its xCamGroup; zPlayer's viewportIndex
// at +0xFC, cheatMode at +0x208 and hidden at +0x209; zScaleform 0x140 on
// zUI (0xF8 bytes, its asset at +0x40 and `visible` at +0xE0) with
// World::ScaleformOGAsset as its SECOND base at +0xF8; zScaleformAsset's
// ids from +0xA8. The padding is padding.
//
// zUI::DoSetup and zUI::DoExit are empty and were folded by the linker
// onto __ct__Q24Math8Matrix33Fv, the name the image keeps for that
// address; zScaleform's overrides call them by that name.

